{"seq":1,"slug":"visitor-pattern","title":"Visitor 模式与节点遍历变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/transformers/visitor-pattern","wordCount":554,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"visitor-模式与节点遍历变换\">Visitor 模式与节点遍历变换</h1><p>Custom Transformer 的核心编程范式是 Visitor 模式——你定义一个&quot;访问函数&quot;，编译器自动将它应用到 AST 的每个节点上，你决定对每个节点做什么：原样返回、替换为新节点、或直接删除。这一机制基于 <code>ts.visitNode</code> 和 <code>ts.visitEachChild</code> 两个核心函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TypeScript 的 Transformer 系统与 Babel 的 Visitor 有本质区别：Babel 的 visitor 是&quot;注册感兴趣的节点类型，编译器只在匹配时回调&quot;；TypeScript 的 visitor 是&quot;你收到每一个节点，自己判断是否需要处理&quot;。这给了你更大的灵活性，但也要求你正确处理递归。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as Emitter&#10;    participant T as Transformer&#10;    participant V as Visitor Function&#10;    participant F as NodeFactory&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;T: 传入 SourceFile&#10;    T-&gt;&gt;V: visitNode(sourceFile, visitor)&#10;    V-&gt;&gt;V: visitEachChild(node, visitor, context)&#10;    V-&gt;&gt;F: factory.createXxx() / factory.updateXxx()&#10;    F--&gt;&gt;V: 返回新节点&#10;    V--&gt;&gt;T: 返回变换后的 SourceFile&#10;    T--&gt;&gt;E: 发射变换结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as Emitter\n    participant T as Transformer\n    participant V as Visitor Function\n    participant F as NodeFactory\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;T: 传入 SourceFile\n    T-&gt;&gt;V: visitNode(sourceFile, visitor)\n    V-&gt;&gt;V: visitEachChild(node, visitor, context)\n    V-&gt;&gt;F: factory.createXxx() / factory.updateXxx()\n    F--&gt;&gt;V: 返回新节点\n    V--&gt;&gt;T: 返回变换后的 SourceFile\n    T--&gt;&gt;E: 发射变换结果</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>返回值语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ts.visitNode(node, visitor)</code></td>\n<td>对单个节点应用 visitor</td>\n<td>返回变换后的节点（或 undefined 表示删除）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ts.visitEachChild(node, visitor, context)</code></td>\n<td>递归变换所有子节点</td>\n<td>返回子节点被替换后的父节点副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>visitor(node)</code></td>\n<td>你的处理逻辑</td>\n<td>返回新节点/原节点/undefined</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"transformer-的基本结构\">Transformer 的基本结构</h2><p>每个 Transformer 是一个满足特定签名的工厂函数。最外层接收 <code>TransformationContext</code>，返回一个接收根节点、返回根节点的变换函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import ts from &#39;typescript&#39;;&#10;&#10;const myTransformer: ts.TransformerFactory&lt;ts.SourceFile&gt; = (context) =&gt; {&#10;  return (sourceFile) =&gt; {&#10;    function visitor(node: ts.Node): ts.Node {&#10;      // 1. 先递归处理子节点（后序遍历）&#10;      node = ts.visitEachChild(node, visitor, context);&#10;&#10;      // 2. 再处理当前节点&#10;      if (ts.isStringLiteral(node) &amp;&amp; node.text === &#39;hello&#39;) {&#10;        return context.factory.createStringLiteral(&#39;world&#39;);&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      // 3. 不需要修改的节点原样返回&#10;      return node;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return ts.visitNode(sourceFile, visitor) as ts.SourceFile;&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> myTransformer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TransformerFactory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 1. 先递归处理子节点（后序遍历）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">visitEachChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, visitor, context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 2. 再处理当前节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isStringLiteral</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.factory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createStringLiteral</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'world'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 3. 不需要修改的节点原样返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">visitNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sourceFile, visitor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"前序遍历-vs-后序遍历\">前序遍历 vs 后序遍历</h2><p><code>visitEachChild</code> 的调用时机决定了遍历顺序——这会影响变换的语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 后序（bottom-up）：先处理子节点，再处理当前节点&#10;// 适合：当你需要基于子节点的变换结果做决策&#10;function bottomUpVisitor(node: ts.Node): ts.Node {&#10;  node = ts.visitEachChild(node, bottomUpVisitor, context);&#10;  // 此时 node 的子节点已经是变换后的版本&#10;  return transformCurrent(node);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 前序（top-down）：先处理当前节点，再处理子节点&#10;// 适合：当你需要阻止某些子树的进一步遍历&#10;function topDownVisitor(node: ts.Node): ts.Node {&#10;  if (shouldSkip(node)) {&#10;    return node; // 不调用 visitEachChild，跳过整个子树&#10;  }&#10;  const transformed = transformCurrent(node);&#10;  return ts.visitEachChild(transformed, topDownVisitor, context);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后序（bottom-up）：先处理子节点，再处理当前节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 适合：当你需要基于子节点的变换结果做决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bottomUpVisitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">visitEachChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, bottomUpVisitor, context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 此时 node 的子节点已经是变换后的版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformCurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 前序（top-down）：先处理当前节点，再处理子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 适合：当你需要阻止某些子树的进一步遍历</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> topDownVisitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shouldSkip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不调用 visitEachChild，跳过整个子树</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transformed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformCurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c